wb-welrok (0.1.9) RELEASED; urgency=low

  * Batch and debounce commands via _cmd_pending/_command_loop
  * Split run() into _poll_loop and _command_loop running concurrently
    with asyncio.gather. Commands are queued into _cmd_pending dict with
    0.5s debounce and last-write-wins deduplication. After each batch,
    _poll_event wakes _poll_loop for immediate UI refresh (~1s vs ~10s).
  * Fix inner MQTT killed on HTTP error — removed mqtt.stop() from
    connection error handlers in _poll_loop; only kept in run() finally.
  * Apply sensor error flags on first init, not only from second poll
  * Guard _control_type update while f.5 (air sensor loss) is active

 -- Ivan Belokrylov <belokrylov.i@welrok.com>  Thu, 17 Jun 2026 11:02:45 +0300

