wb-welrok (0.1.4) RELEASED; urgency=low

  * Add air/floor control type detection via controlType (param 3)
  * Fix temperature command routing: manualAir (param 4) for air mode, manualFloorTemperature (param 5) for floor mode
  * Fix wrong HTTP data_type for temperature commands on AZ devices (int8 vs int16)
  * Split mode switch and temperature into separate sequential commands
  * Add SET_TEMP_KEEP_SCHEDULE_MODE flag: set tempTemperature (param 29) without switching to manual
  * Fix UI flicker on temperature change: pending set temp guard set before first await
  * Fix sensor error indicator never shown in UI: publish error flag to MQTT control meta per control
  * Fix crash in temperature formatter when sensor error text passed instead of numeric value
  * Add fault codes f.3/f.4 (floor sensor open/short circuit) with per-control error flag
  * Add fault codes f.5 (air sensor loss), f.23 (air sensor battery low) for OZ devices
  * Add fault codes f.9 (overheat), f.12 (overheat sensor circuit error) for AZ and OZ devices

 -- Ivan Belokrylov <belokrylov.i@welrok.com>  Thu, 25 Mar 2026 17:01:56 +0300

